              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used a frozen banana which eliminated the need for ice. I also did not add any extra sugar. I thought this was good--the kids did not like it, though. I'd make this again for me."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
