            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lutzflcat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is more of a milkshake rather than a smoothie even thought I did add extra ice. The banana flavor totally overwhelmed the mild apricots. All I could taste was banana and sweetness. In spite of that, it still was good, but doubtful I'd make again.",
